@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/use-case-diagram
hide footbox

actor User
participant System

User -> System : 1. Inserts registration details\n(name, email, password)
System -> System: 1.1 Checks if input data is valid
System -> System: 1.2 Checks if account already exists

alt Data valid and account does not exist : True
    System -> System: 1.3 Creates and stores account
    System --> User : returns success
else Account exists or invalid data : False
    System --> User : return failure

end



@enduml